
# Python Data Generation

This folder contains the Python scripts used to generate the e-commerce project datasets.

Libraries used:
 - NumPy
 - Pandas
 - Faker
 - tqdm
 - OS
 - datetime


The scripts has generated the following datasets:
 - dim_customer
 - dim_order
 - dim_product
 - fact_order_items

